    "{what}を果たした{name}は、その後もリングの中心で戦い続けている。実績にふさわしい内容を積み重ねられるか。ここ数戦の結果が、今後の立ち位置を左右しそうだ。": "{name}, who did it — {what} — has gone on fighting at the center of the ring. Whether the work matches the record is the question. The last few results look likely to decide where she stands from here.",
